15. BUSINESS RULES

- Client applications never access financial secrets.
- All financial operations are server-side.
- Offline capabilities are mandatory.
- Geographic intelligence is natively supported.
- Environmental intelligence is a core architectural component.
- Historical financial records are immutable.
- Security and scalability take priority over convenience.



